  + separates raw upstream identities parsed values component digests receipt digest and evidence identities
  + proves seven plus fifteen equals twenty-two and zero overlap while pure issued capability count remains zero
  + distinguishes supplied commission syntax from issuance authentication consent current clock lease ledger and execution facts

& [IntentionalHemisphere]
  + preserves the user's movement toward a self-working local host without fabricating a physical commission
  + treats correction before implementation as progress because it prevents an omitted lifecycle transition from becoming executable authority
  + preserves one-use accountability retained failure truth exact attribution and later independent review boundaries
  + keeps the provider host policy storage floor D-drive WSL and foreign-work constraints intact

& [Tension]
